- Every boundary preflight now carries its own plan SHA: source `f5a35ecae178eb31aa9e6375eb26e176ea55b4d00fb7c5139e8a8e6d7264eae6d`, JS `9ac6581a5f204185fb202c2675667cce5bda8d9850b44f42ca26640d08303ac2`, Native `933e669e9617cde761a58a3ead98d086e9c97f4bed7871471d0b2608bb65ea64`; collector execute arguments carry the same joins. Launch and outer parent hashes were re-bound accordingly.
