The launch remains diagnostic only. Its completion still requires actual source control, fresh JS whole-oracle equality, Native emit/build/runtime under the declared caps, empty runtime consumer stderr, and exact restoration. A deadline or incomplete stage earns no credit. The held report's semantic and adoption limitations remain binding; this successor adds no new compiler finding.
